  "details": "The `Open Help Documentation` button on `Email One-Time Code` dialog in the login sequence does not work. No action happens when you press the button.\n\nSo I guess it is intended to open a web page with a browser and other buttons to open the browser work properly (for instance `MM > Settings > Avatars > Avatar Optimizations`).\n\n# Repro steps:\n\n1. Start the app (I use the Steam version)\n\n2. Select the login method, and enter username and password correctly\n\n3. The app sometimes goes to the `Email One-Time Code` view. (I am not sure how to force this behavior)\n\n4. Press the `Cancel` button, then the app goes to another `Email One-Time Code` view\n\n5. Press the `Open Help Documentation` button",
